            "Connect: starts the link with the rig. “Connecting...”: the rig is not answering yet (click: stop). “Disconnect”: the rig answers; the link is checked every minute (right-click: button colours)", "Forbind: starter forbindelsen med radioen. \"Forbinder...\": radioen svarer ikke endnu (klik: stop). \"Afbryd\": radioen svarer; forbindelsen kontrolleres hvert minut (højreklik: knappens farver)",
