            "USB or LSB mode (at least 500 Hz bandwidth), on an RTTY signal (14.080 to 14.099 MHz…).", "Način USB ili LSB (širina pojasa najmanje 500 Hz), na RTTY signalu (14.080 do 14.099 MHz…).",
            "USB mode, on a PSK31 signal (14.070, 7.035, 3.580 MHz…); the audio frequency is found automatically (or set by hand). PSK63 possible.", "Način USB, na PSK31 signalu (14.070, 7.035, 3.580 MHz…); audio frekvencija nalazi se automatski (ili se postavlja ručno). PSK63 moguć.",
            "USB mode, on an Olivia signal (calling 8/250: 14.0729, 7.0729, 3.5729 MHz…; 16/500 and 32/1000 a little higher, around 14.075 and 14.106 MHz). Set the transmitter's number of tones and bandwidth: they must be the same as its own; common formats: 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. The signal's centre is found automatically in the spectrum (or fixed by hand). The text appears in blocks, a few seconds after synchronisation; the signal can even be well below the noise. Receive only.", "USB način rada, na Olivia signalu (pozivna frekvencija 8/250: 14.0729, 7.0729, 3.5729 MHz…; 16/500 i 32/1000 nešto više, oko 14.075 i 14.106 MHz). Podesite broj tonova i širinu pojasa predajnika: moraju biti jednaki njegovima; uobičajeni formati: 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. Središte signala automatski se pronalazi u spektru (ili se zadaje ručno). Tekst se pojavljuje u blokovima, nekoliko sekundi nakon sinkronizacije; signal može biti i znatno ispod razine šuma. Samo prijam.",
            "UTC time · text. The window caption shows the synchronisation, the signal-to-noise ratio and the frequency offset.", "UTC vrijeme · tekst. Naslov prozora prikazuje sinkronizaciju, omjer signala i šuma te odstupanje frekvencije.",
            "USB mode, on a Contestia signal (an Olivia variant with 6-bit characters: 3.5825, 7.0425, 14.0725 MHz…). Set the transmitter's number of tones and bandwidth: common formats 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. The signal's centre is found automatically in the spectrum (or fixed by hand). Receive only.", "USB način rada, na Contestia signalu (inačica Olivie sa 6-bitnim znakovima: 3.5825, 7.0425, 14.0725 MHz…). Podesite broj tonova i širinu pojasa predajnika: uobičajeni formati 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. Središte signala automatski se pronalazi u spektru (ili se zadaje ručno). Samo prijam.",
            "USB mode, on a Hellschreiber signal (Feld Hell: 14.063, 7.046, 3.592 MHz…; FM Hell 105: 3.585, 7.0695, 10.1425 MHz…). Choose the transmitter's variant: Feld Hell, Slow Hell, Hell X5, Hell X9, FM Hell 105, FM Hell 245 or Hell 80. The text is not decoded into letters: it is written as a picture that you read by eye, like on the original machine (14-dot lines scrolling up). The frequency is found automatically in the spectrum; the dot rows line up by themselves. Receive only.", "USB način rada, na Hellschreiber signalu (Feld Hell: 14.063, 7.046, 3.592 MHz…; FM Hell 105: 3.585, 7.0695, 10.1425 MHz…). Odaberite inačicu predajnika: Feld Hell, Slow Hell, Hell X5, Hell X9, FM Hell 105, FM Hell 245 ili Hell 80. Tekst se ne dekodira u slova: ispisuje se kao slika koju čitate okom, kao na izvornom stroju (retci od 14 točaka koji se pomiču prema gore). Frekvencija se automatski pronalazi u spektru; redovi točaka poravnavaju se sami. Samo prijam.",
            "Picture: the letters are written from left to right and the line wraps at its end. If the text looks slanted, the two stations' clocks differ slightly: tracking catches up by itself.", "Slika: slova se pišu slijeva nadesno, a redak se na kraju prelama. Ako tekst izgleda nakošeno, satovi dviju postaja malo se razlikuju: praćenje se samo ispravlja.",
            "USB mode, 1.9 kHz below the published frequency of the weather fax station (DWD Pinneberg 3.855, 7.880, 13.8825 MHz; Northwood 2.618, 4.610, 8.040 MHz…), or on an amateur FAX signal. Black 1500 Hz, white 2300 Hz. The picture starts at the start tone (its IOC, 576 or 288, is recognised) and ends at the stop tone; it is saved at the end. Most stations send 120 lines per minute, IOC 576.", "Način USB, 1,9 kHz ispod objavljene frekvencije meteorološke faks postaje (DWD Pinneberg 3.855, 7.880, 13.8825 MHz; Northwood 2.618, 4.610, 8.040 MHz…), ili na radioamaterskom FAX signalu. Crna 1500 Hz, bijela 2300 Hz. Slika počinje na početnom tonu (njezin IOC, 576 ili 288, prepoznaje se) i završava na završnom tonu; sprema se na kraju. Većina postaja šalje 120 redaka u minuti, IOC 576.",
            "If the picture slants, the sound card or the WebSDR is not running at quite the right rate: correct it with “Slant correction”. If the picture is shifted to the right, it was picked up midway (without phasing lines).", "Ako je slika nagnuta, zvučna kartica ili WebSDR ne radi baš točnim taktom: ispravite to pomoću „Korekcija nagiba”. Ako je slika pomaknuta udesno, uhvaćena je usred prijenosa (bez linija fazinga).",
            "USB mode (at least 2.4 kHz bandwidth), on an SSTV frequency (14.230, 7.033, 3.730 MHz…); the picture mode is recognised automatically, the picture builds up line by line and is saved when it ends.", "Način USB (širina pojasa najmanje 2,4 kHz), na SSTV frekvenciji (14.230, 7.033, 3.730 MHz…); način slike prepoznaje se automatski, slika se gradi redak po redak i sprema se na kraju.",
            "Sensitivity (1 to 10): the higher the number, the weaker the signals the decoder accepts (start code, sync pulses, lines), at the risk of a few false detections.", "Osjetljivost (1 do 10): što je broj veći, to slabije signale dekoder prihvaća (početni kod, sinkronizacijski impulsi, linije), uz rizik nekoliko lažnih detekcija.",
            "Data loss (1 to 10): how long the decoder keeps going with a picture when the signal disappears (3 s at 1, 12 s at 4, 120 s at 10). If the signal comes back in that time, the picture resumes at the right line and the lost lines stay grey. After that time the picture is saved as it is and the decoder listens again (it then finds the mode by itself).", "Gubitak podataka (1 do 10): koliko dugo dekoder nastavlja sa slikom kada signal nestane (3 s kod 1, 12 s kod 4, 120 s kod 10). Ako se signal vrati u tom vremenu, slika se nastavlja na ispravnoj liniji, a izgubljene linije ostaju sive. Nakon tog vremena slika se sprema takva kakva jest, a dekoder ponovno sluša (tada sam pronalazi način rada).",
            "The reception chosen as for FreeDV (rig, otherwise WebSDR, otherwise ExpertSDR, otherwise HDSDR) is analysed continuously (a muted reception is not chosen; if all are muted, decoding goes on with the rig or the WebSDR).", "Prijem odabran kao za FreeDV (uređaj, inače WebSDR, inače ExpertSDR, inače HDSDR) analizira se neprekidno (utišani prijem se ne odabire; ako su svi utišani, dekodiranje se nastavlja s uređajem ili WebSDR-om).",
