            "Connect: starts the link with the rig. “Connecting...”: the rig is not answering yet (click: stop). “Disconnect”: the rig answers; the link is checked every minute (right-click: button colours)", "Spoji: pokreće vezu s uređajem. „Spajanje...”: uređaj još ne odgovara (klik: zaustavi). „Odspoji”: uređaj odgovara; veza se provjerava svake minute (desni klik: boje gumba)",
