            "End the picture and save it", "Končaj sliko in jo shrani",
            "USB or DATA mode, on an FT8 (7.074, 14.074 MHz…) or FT4 (7.0475, 14.080 MHz…) frequency. The PC clock must be accurate.", "Način USB ali DATA, na frekvenci FT8 (7.074, 14.074 MHz…) ali FT4 (7.0475, 14.080 MHz…). Ura računalnika mora biti točna.",
            "UTC time · DT (s) · audio frequency (Hz) · message. The two periods (even and odd) are shown in two colours.", "Čas UTC · DT (s) · zvočna frekvenca (Hz) · sporočilo. Obe periodi (sodo in liho) sta prikazani v dveh barvah.",
            "USB or DATA mode, on an FT2 frequency (3.578, 7.052, 14.084 MHz…). FT2 is FT4 at double speed: 3.75 s slots, 2.5 s messages, 170 Hz wide. The PC clock must be accurate. Reception only; weak signals decode less well than in FT4 (shorter symbols).", "Način USB ali DATA, na frekvenci FT2 (3.578, 7.052, 14.084 MHz…). FT2 je FT4 z dvojno hitrostjo: reže po 3.75 s, sporočila po 2.5 s, širina 170 Hz. Ura računalnika mora biti točna. Samo sprejem; šibke signale dekodira slabše kot FT4 (krajši simboli).",
            "USB mode, on a WSPR frequency (14.0956, 7.0386, 10.1387 MHz…: carrier frequency + 1500 Hz). 2-minute slots; the PC clock must be accurate; first results at the end of the first slot.", "Način USB, na frekvenci WSPR (14.0956, 7.0386, 10.1387 MHz…: frekvenca nosilca + 1500 Hz). Časovne reže po 2 minuti; ura računalnika mora biti točna; prvi rezultati ob koncu prve reže.",
            "UTC time · SNR (dB) · DT (s) · audio frequency (Hz) · callsign, locator, power (dBm).", "Čas UTC · SNR (dB) · DT (s) · zvočna frekvenca (Hz) · klicni znak, lokator, moč (dBm).",
            "USB mode, on a JT9 frequency (14.078, 7.078, 3.578 MHz…). 1-minute slots; the PC clock must be accurate.", "Način USB, na frekvenci JT9 (14.078, 7.078, 3.578 MHz…). Časovne reže po 1 minuto; ura računalnika mora biti točna.",
            "UTC time · SNR (dB) · DT (s) · audio frequency (Hz) · message.", "Čas UTC · SNR (dB) · DT (s) · zvočna frekvenca (Hz) · sporočilo.",
            "USB mode, on a JS8Call frequency (14.078, 7.078, 3.578 MHz…). Receive only: heartbeat frames, directed messages, free text. Choose the transmitter's speed (the Speed list below): Slow (30 s slots), Normal (15 s), Fast (10 s), Turbo (6 s), Ultra (4 s); it must be the same as the station you listen to. The PC clock must be accurate.", "Način USB, na frekvenci JS8Call (14.078, 7.078, 3.578 MHz…). Samo sprejem: okvirji heartbeat, naslovljena sporočila, prosto besedilo. Izberite hitrost oddajnika (seznam Hitrost spodaj): Počasi (reže po 30 s), Običajno (15 s), Hitro (10 s), Turbo (6 s), Ultra (4 s); biti mora enaka kot pri postaji, ki jo poslušate. Ura računalnika mora biti točna.",
            "UTC time · SNR (dB) · DT (s) · audio frequency (Hz) · frame (sender callsign: addressee or command, text). The two periods (even and odd) are shown in two colours.", "Čas UTC · SNR (dB) · DT (s) · zvočna frekvenca (Hz) · okvir (klicni znak pošiljatelja: naslovnik ali ukaz, besedilo). Obdobji (sodo in liho) sta prikazani v dveh barvah.",
            "CW or USB mode, on a CW signal.", "Način CW ali USB, na signalu CW.",
            "UTC time · text.", "Čas UTC · besedilo.",
            "USB or LSB mode (at least 500 Hz bandwidth), on an RTTY signal (14.080 to 14.099 MHz…).", "Način USB ali LSB (pasovna širina vsaj 500 Hz), na signalu RTTY (14.080 do 14.099 MHz…).",
            "USB mode, on a PSK31 signal (14.070, 7.035, 3.580 MHz…); the audio frequency is found automatically (or set by hand). PSK63 possible.", "Način USB, na signalu PSK31 (14.070, 7.035, 3.580 MHz…); zvočna frekvenca se najde samodejno (ali nastavi ročno). PSK63 mogoč.",
            "USB mode, on an Olivia signal (calling 8/250: 14.0729, 7.0729, 3.5729 MHz…; 16/500 and 32/1000 a little higher, around 14.075 and 14.106 MHz). Set the transmitter's number of tones and bandwidth: they must be the same as its own; common formats: 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. The signal's centre is found automatically in the spectrum (or fixed by hand). The text appears in blocks, a few seconds after synchronisation; the signal can even be well below the noise. Receive only.", "Način USB, na signalu Olivia (klic 8/250: 14.0729, 7.0729, 3.5729 MHz…; 16/500 in 32/1000 malo višje, okoli 14.075 in 14.106 MHz). Nastavite število tonov in pasovno širino oddajnika: biti morata enaka njegovima; običajni formati: 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. Središče signala se samodejno najde v spektru (ali pa ga določite ročno). Besedilo se prikazuje v blokih, nekaj sekund po sinhronizaciji; signal je lahko tudi precej pod ravnjo šuma. Samo sprejem.",
            "UTC time · text. The window caption shows the synchronisation, the signal-to-noise ratio and the frequency offset.", "Čas UTC · besedilo. Naslov okna prikazuje sinhronizacijo, razmerje signal/šum in frekvenčni odmik.",
            "USB mode, on a Contestia signal (an Olivia variant with 6-bit characters: 3.5825, 7.0425, 14.0725 MHz…). Set the transmitter's number of tones and bandwidth: common formats 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. The signal's centre is found automatically in the spectrum (or fixed by hand). Receive only.", "Način USB, na signalu Contestia (različica Olivie s 6-bitnimi znaki: 3.5825, 7.0425, 14.0725 MHz…). Nastavite število tonov in pasovno širino oddajnika: običajni formati 8/250, 16/500, 32/1000. Središče signala se samodejno najde v spektru (ali pa ga določite ročno). Samo sprejem.",
            "USB mode, on a Hellschreiber signal (Feld Hell: 14.063, 7.046, 3.592 MHz…; FM Hell 105: 3.585, 7.0695, 10.1425 MHz…). Choose the transmitter's variant: Feld Hell, Slow Hell, Hell X5, Hell X9, FM Hell 105, FM Hell 245 or Hell 80. The text is not decoded into letters: it is written as a picture that you read by eye, like on the original machine (14-dot lines scrolling up). The frequency is found automatically in the spectrum; the dot rows line up by themselves. Receive only.", "Način USB, na signalu Hellschreiber (Feld Hell: 14.063, 7.046, 3.592 MHz…; FM Hell 105: 3.585, 7.0695, 10.1425 MHz…). Izberite različico oddajnika: Feld Hell, Slow Hell, Hell X5, Hell X9, FM Hell 105, FM Hell 245 ali Hell 80. Besedilo se ne dekodira v črke: zapiše se kot slika, ki jo preberete z očmi, kot na izvirnem stroju (vrstice s 14 pikami, ki se pomikajo navzgor). Frekvenca se samodejno najde v spektru; vrste pik se poravnajo same. Samo sprejem.",
            "Picture: the letters are written from left to right and the line wraps at its end. If the text looks slanted, the two stations' clocks differ slightly: tracking catches up by itself.", "Slika: črke se pišejo od leve proti desni, na koncu se vrstica nadaljuje v naslednji. Če se besedilo zdi nagnjeno, se uri obeh postaj malo razlikujeta: sledenje se samo popravi.",
            "USB mode, 1.9 kHz below the published frequency of the weather fax station (DWD Pinneberg 3.855, 7.880, 13.8825 MHz; Northwood 2.618, 4.610, 8.040 MHz…), or on an amateur FAX signal. Black 1500 Hz, white 2300 Hz. The picture starts at the start tone (its IOC, 576 or 288, is recognised) and ends at the stop tone; it is saved at the end. Most stations send 120 lines per minute, IOC 576.", "Način USB, 1,9 kHz pod objavljeno frekvenco vremenske faksimilne postaje (DWD Pinneberg 3.855, 7.880, 13.8825 MHz; Northwood 2.618, 4.610, 8.040 MHz…), ali na radioamaterskem signalu FAX. Črna 1500 Hz, bela 2300 Hz. Slika se začne ob začetnem tonu (njen IOC, 576 ali 288, se prepozna) in konča ob končnem tonu; shrani se na koncu. Večina postaj oddaja 120 vrstic na minuto, IOC 576.",
            "If the picture slants, the sound card or the WebSDR is not running at quite the right rate: correct it with “Slant correction”. If the picture is shifted to the right, it was picked up midway (without phasing lines).", "Če je slika nagnjena, zvočna kartica ali WebSDR ne deluje povsem s pravo hitrostjo: popravite to s „Popravek nagiba“. Če je slika zamaknjena v desno, je bila ujeta med potekom (brez fazirnih vrstic).",
            "USB mode (at least 2.4 kHz bandwidth), on an SSTV frequency (14.230, 7.033, 3.730 MHz…); the picture mode is recognised automatically, the picture builds up line by line and is saved when it ends.", "Način USB (pasovna širina vsaj 2,4 kHz), na frekvenci SSTV (14.230, 7.033, 3.730 MHz…); način slike se prepozna samodejno, slika se gradi vrstico za vrstico in se shrani ob koncu.",
            "Sensitivity (1 to 10): the higher the number, the weaker the signals the decoder accepts (start code, sync pulses, lines), at the risk of a few false detections.", "Občutljivost (1 do 10): višja ko je številka, šibkejše signale sprejme dekoder (začetna koda, sinhronizacijski impulzi, vrstice), s tveganjem nekaj napačnih zaznav.",
            "Data loss (1 to 10): how long the decoder keeps going with a picture when the signal disappears (3 s at 1, 12 s at 4, 120 s at 10). If the signal comes back in that time, the picture resumes at the right line and the lost lines stay grey. After that time the picture is saved as it is and the decoder listens again (it then finds the mode by itself).", "Izguba podatkov (1 do 10): kako dolgo dekoder nadaljuje s sliko, ko signal izgine (3 s pri 1, 12 s pri 4, 120 s pri 10). Če se signal v tem času vrne, se slika nadaljuje na pravi vrstici, izgubljene vrstice pa ostanejo sive. Po tem času se slika shrani takšna, kot je, dekoder pa spet posluša (način nato najde sam).",
            "The reception chosen as for FreeDV (rig, otherwise WebSDR, otherwise ExpertSDR, otherwise HDSDR) is analysed continuously (a muted reception is not chosen; if all are muted, decoding goes on with the rig or the WebSDR).", "Sprejem, izbran enako kot za FreeDV (postaja, sicer WebSDR, sicer ExpertSDR, sicer HDSDR), se neprekinjeno analizira (utišan sprejem se ne izbere; če so utišani vsi, se dekodiranje nadaljuje s postajo ali WebSDR).",
